null,2,null,1]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["超乎預期的小店\n老闆人超級客氣親切的\n是一種像到朋友家吃飯的感覺\n上錯多給的菜也送我們吃\n還時不時看有沒有太悶熱開電風扇\n補豚骨清湯給我們喝\n重點是拉麵真的非常好吃\n不能說是道地的日式拉麵\n（我自己是各種厲害的日式拉麵都吃到有點膩了）\n但真的調味非常不錯\n我們這次點的是蒜味豚骨跟醬油豚骨\n搭配可免費加麵的細麵\n全部吃光光\n如果不是為了身體健康著想\n湯也想全部喝完\n8歲小孩子的接受度也很高\n一直說很好吃\n下次一定會再來試試看其他餐點！",null,[0,32]]]],[null,1774461195000000,1774461195000000,"5 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfZXBjQlpSSS1TM2hydWQzb0FrX3NMUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfZXBjQlpSSS1TM2hydWQzb0FrX3NMURoTQ2d3SWk4S1F6Z1lRa1p2QjZnRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwjwopX1ydKWAxXkk68BHUSeDooQ_2MIdigG"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16662918959180402149/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVms1dVZtbGxiVXA2VkZkT1YxZHRjSFppYkhCWlRGaFJkMVZYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16662918959180402149/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVms1dVZtbGxiVXA2VkZkT1YxZHRjSFppYkhCWlRGaFJkMVZYWXhBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/16662918959180402149/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVms1dVZtbGxiVXA2VkZkT1YxZHRjSFppYkhCWlRGaFJkMVZYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16662918959180402149/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVms1dVZtbGxiVXA2VkZkT1YxZHRjSFppYkhCWlRGaFJkMVZYWXhBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/16662918959180402149/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVms1dVZtbGxiVXA2VkZkT1YxZHRjSFppYkhCWlRGaFJkMVZYWXhBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/16662918959180402149/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFrVms1dVZtbGxiVXA2VkZkT1YxZHRjSFppYkhCWlRGaFJkMVZYWXhBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的肯定！非常謝謝您",null,[0,12]]]],[null,null,2685,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21kVk5uVmllbUp6VFdOV